# Static-analysis policy for Tier. Run in CI as a gate (the clang-tidy job
# passes -warnings-as-errors); WarningsAsErrors is left empty here so a local
# run is advisory and does not fail a developer's build.
#
# The check set is deliberately the high-signal, low-noise families. The broad
# cppcoreguidelines-pro-* checks (reinterpret-cast, pointer arithmetic,
# array-to-pointer decay) fire pervasively and by design in a QUIC/socket
# transport that parses wire bytes and talks to C APIs, so they are not enforced
# here; enabling them would be noise, not signal. bugprone-easily-swappable-
# parameters is likewise excluded as stylistic.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/(libs|apps)/.*'
